      "id": "api-comment-41efd0a0",
      "action": "translate",
      "new_text": "Sign in, identify the signed-in person and sign out. Challenge, PKCE, `id_token` verification, tenant resolution and session logic live in `@pipe/autenticacao`; this is the HTTP adapter for cookies, redirects and response format. A sign-in failure never presents a 500 to the person, who cannot use a stack trace. Every failure redirects to the sign-in screen with `?erro=<codigo>` from the contract's `RECUSAS_DE_ENTRADA` catalog; the screen chooses the explanation and next step.",
